cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "if you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: >-
  gpath2vec: Pathway-Informed Feature Embeddings for Biological
  Observations from Gene Sets
abstract: >-
  a python package for converting gene sets to biological pathway embeddings
  with enrichment analysis attributes. gene sets from clusters, niches or
  studies are tested against reactome pathways by fisher's exact test or
  niche-level AUCell, then embedded into a shared vector space using
  metapath2vec over the reactome pathway hierarchy graph.
